Filetype: IR signals file
Version: 1
#
# Flameless candle remote — REAL CAPTURE (Flipper Zero, NEC, address 0x00).
# Six buttons; the names below are the Flipper's own, and the DMX cue maps
# reference them verbatim (candles:On, candles:Candle, ...). Re-capturing the
# remote and dropping the file in here needs no renaming.
#
#   On       0x45   all candles on
#   Off      0x47   all candles off
#   Candle   0x16   flicker mode
#   Light    0x0D   steady mode
#   Dim      0x0C   nudge dimmer
#   Brighten 0x5E   nudge brighter
#
# This remote has NO timer buttons -- the old TIMER_4H/TIMER_8H placeholders
# were invented, and the cue maps no longer reference them.
#
name: On
type: parsed
protocol: NEC
address: 00 00 00 00
command: 45 00 00 00
#
name: Off
type: parsed
protocol: NEC
address: 00 00 00 00
command: 47 00 00 00
#
name: Candle
type: parsed
protocol: NEC
address: 00 00 00 00
command: 16 00 00 00
#
name: Light
type: parsed
protocol: NEC
address: 00 00 00 00
command: 0D 00 00 00
#
name: Dim
type: parsed
protocol: NEC
address: 00 00 00 00
command: 0C 00 00 00
#
name: Brighten
type: parsed
protocol: NEC
address: 00 00 00 00
command: 5E 00 00 00
